// How editing behaves where that's a choice. Read by the app
// (crates/app/src/resources.rs) and its tests.
(
    // Typing a web or e-mail address makes it a link once a space or
    // punctuation follows it, as GitHub's autolinks read it, and Undo
    // right after takes the link off, leaving the text (review jy4a2tx5).
    // In Markdown documents it must, or the file would read back
    // otherwise; in xWorks documents it's still open with the owner.
    links_as_typed: (markdown: true, xworks: false),
)
